sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as MCP 客户端
    participant Tool as list_notes
    participant Read as flomoReadClient
    participant HTTP as FlomoHttpClient
    participant Flomo as flomo Web
    participant Parser as memoParser

    Client->>Tool: call list_notes(limit)
    Tool->>Read: list(limit)
    Read->>HTTP: requestJson(FLOMO_READ_ENDPOINT)
    HTTP->>Flomo: GET/POST internal endpoint
    Flomo-->>HTTP: raw JSON
    HTTP-->>Read: raw JSON
    Read->>Parser: parseMemo(raw)
    Parser-->>Read: Memo[]
    Read-->>Tool: Memo[]
    Tool-->>Client: { ok: true, items }
